# Lychee skips the URLs matching these patterns. It reads this file from the
# directory it runs in, the repository root. `lychee.toml` comes from `config`
# and `./config/pull` overwrites it, so links specific to this site go here.
#
# Remove a pattern once the module update that fixes its link lands here.

# Broken in the docs of `SpineEventEngine/documentation`, which
# `site/config/_default/hugo.toml` imports as a module. Fixed by
# https://github.com/SpineEventEngine/documentation/pull/96.
^https://stackoverflow\.com/a/31814967/3183076$

# Broken in the docs of `SpineEventEngine/validation`, which come in through
# `SpineEventEngine/documentation`, so they can only be fixed there.
# See https://github.com/SpineEventEngine/documentation/issues/97.
^https://github\.com/SpineEventEngine/validation/blob/master/\.agents/running-builds\.md$
^https://github\.com/SpineEventEngine/validation/blob/master/\.agents/documentation-guidelines\.md$
^https://github\.com/SpineEventEngine/embed-code-go/blob/master/EMBEDDING\.md$
^https://github\.com/SpineEventEngine/embed-code-go/tree/master/bin$
^https://plugins\.gradle\.org/plugin/io\.spine\.validation$
# Relative links that resolve outside the module's pages.
^http://localhost:[0-9]+/06-developers-guide/$
^http://localhost:[0-9]+/developer/$
^http://localhost:[0-9]+/typical_custom_option\.jpg$
